    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scare: Fatal Picture \u2013 Manga Story is a narrative experience based on the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\thorror game Scare: Fatal Picture. Presented in a stylish black-and-white manga </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tformat. This game reveals both the events you\u2019ve already seen and the dark </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tsecrets that were never shown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAfter each chapter, test your memory by answering key questions to unlock the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tnext part of the story. Pay attention\u2026 or stay trapped in the nightmare.</p>",
